{"w":2400,"lines":[{"y":0.046511627815394085,"t":"1718867188","w":0.069958845774332645,"x":0.7716049391467531,"c":0.5,"h":0.008720930389296444},{"t":"PETER:","x":0.10082304557669057,"h":0.0087209303892965551,"y":0.098837209204136078,"w":0.049382715225219739,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"JAN:","y":0.14244186035560102,"w":0.03086419741312664,"x":0.10082304523082646,"h":0.008720930389296333},{"w":0.049382715225219725,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"PETER:","c":1,"x":0.1008230460396535,"y":0.15552325556411239},{"h":0.0087209298276508251,"w":0.030864197413126626,"x":0.10082304542923917,"t":"JAN:","y":0.18459302331291882,"c":1},{"h":0.010174418787512463,"c":1,"y":0.21366279050449954,"t":"PETER:","w":0.047325102488199877,"x":0.1008230457312087},{"w":0.030864197413126626,"h":0.008720930389296444,"x":0.100823045260889,"t":"JAN:","y":0.24273255802152516,"c":1},{"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1,"x":0.10082304604670939,"t":"PETER:","w":0.047325102488199849,"y":0.25581395322736777},{"t":"JAN:","x":0.10082304523082646,"y":0.28633720919281025,"w":0.03086419741312664,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1},{"t":"PETER:","y":0.29941860439015844,"w":0.047325102488199849,"h":0.010174418787512463,"c":1,"x":0.10082304604670939},{"x":0.10082304542923914,"y":0.3430232559291978,"t":"JAN:","h":0.0087209298276508251,"c":1,"w":0.030864197413126626},{"t":"PETER:","c":1,"y":0.35752079252809899,"x":0.10286629597857119,"h":0.0087956242061475454,"w":0.045296214421590181},{"c":1,"w":0.030864197413126612,"t":"JAN:","x":0.10082304534105573,"h":0.0087209298276509362,"y":0.38662790711690542},{"t":"The island's a great place to explore. It's quite small, and it's got a range of","x":0.19341563744323481,"y":0.097383720823579045,"c":1,"w":0.5576131693522135,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"t":"habitats. It's also an ideal location for seeing seals just off the coast, or even on","y":0.11189634877336374,"h":0.011778563015312105,"x":0.19341563269911793,"c":1,"w":0.58847737630208341},{"t":"OK. And is there anything we should bring, like a picnic, for instance?","h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"x":0.19341563587423366,"w":0.51234568277994796,"y":0.13953488360072841},{"x":0.19335049456424117,"h":0.014708535831303049,"c":1,"w":0.59682917277018233,"t":"Yes, do bring one, as it's a full-day walk. And of course it'll be wet walking across","y":0.15404662728807006},{"y":0.16856307694321249,"x":0.19334502119188088,"c":1,"h":0.013899713298316851,"w":0.37872441609700525,"t":"and back, so make sure your boots are waterproof."},{"h":0.013081395583944611,"w":0.54115224202473955,"t":"I must buy a new pair - there's a hole in one of my current ones! Well, I'd","x":0.19341564861611668,"y":0.18313953475889977,"c":1},{"x":0.19341563273201737,"w":0.25514404296875004,"c":1,"t":"definitely like to come on the walk.","y":0.1975853948513081,"h":0.011778563015312105},{"x":0.19335974361678468,"c":1,"t":"Great. Then later this month we're having a one-day woodwork session in","h":0.012549411562502888,"y":0.21202996539092911,"w":0.54537592569986981},{"t":"Hopton Wood.","w":0.10905349731445313,"h":0.011778563015312216,"x":0.19341563802413736,"c":1,"y":0.22673733777997818},{"t":"I've never tried that before. Is it OK for beginners to take part?","w":0.4588477579752604,"x":0.19341562708279209,"y":0.24116607778814303,"c":1,"h":0.011778563015312216},{"t":"Definitely. There'Il be a couple of experts leading the session, and we keep the","w":0.58230453491210943,"x":0.19341563367376882,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.25581395336844848},{"t":"number of participants down, so you'll get as much help as you need.","y":0.27031802129031623,"h":0.011778563015312216,"w":0.51440327962239585,"c":1,"x":0.19341564404280101},{"h":0.013129396067912524,"y":0.2834206700535491,"x":0.19332070130066512,"t":"Excellent! I'd love to be able to make chairs.","w":0.32940770467122393,"c":1},{"y":0.29796511615129617,"t":"That's probably too ambitious for one day! You'll be starting with wooden spoons,","x":0.19341563083064073,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"w":0.60082305908203126},{"h":0.013250883392226132,"t":"and of course learning how to use the tools. And anything you make is yours to","x":0.19341564177526419,"w":0.58436213175455731,"y":0.31242638385956312,"c":1},{"h":0.014855785280009748,"c":1,"x":0.1911323047721776,"t":"take home with you.","y":0.32563670021523772,"w":0.14866448720296224},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"w":0.24485595703124999,"t":"That sounds like fun. When is it?","x":0.19135802961281892,"y":0.34156976733244115},{"h":0.01472320376914027,"t":"It's on the 17th, from 10 a.m. until 3. There's a charge of £35, including lunch, or","w":0.59465016682942706,"y":0.35453474675375451,"c":1,"x":0.19341565784043041},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.19341564262131375,"t":"£40 if you want to camp in the wood.","y":0.37063953477475642,"w":0.27366254170735682,"c":1},{"t":"I should think I'll come home the same day. Well, I'd certainly like to join the","x":0.19135803243924376,"w":0.5596707661946615,"y":0.38515901084605897,"h":0.014550291607320909,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.19341563827216382,"t":"group.","w":0.049382715225219725,"y":0.40116279047906356,"h":0.010174418787512574},{"t":"Q7","x":0.81893004067654707,"y":0.16860465098577604,"w":0.026748971939086874,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"y":0.23982558124240705,"w":0.026748971939086874,"c":1,"x":0.8189300406679737,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"Q8"},{"y":0.29796511610701026,"w":0.026748971939086874,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"Q9","x":0.8189300406679737,"c":1},{"y":0.3561046510219612,"w":0.034979422887166378,"t":"Q10","h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"x":0.81893004153352589},{"h":0.014534883982160851,"t":"PART 2","w":0.098765430450439465,"y":0.45930232543426319,"c":1,"x":0.10082304598877205},{"c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.66460906982421875,"x":0.10288065015888179,"y":0.48691860454467262,"t":"So, hello everyone. My name's Lou Miller and I'm going to be your tour guide today as we"},{"t":"take this fantastic boat trip around the Tasmanian coast. Before we set off, I just want to tell","x":0.10077194052020579,"c":1,"w":0.67705383300781252,"h":0.014804570497977898,"y":0.49866924376197019},{"w":0.26153121948242186,"x":0.10069234531425707,"y":0.51330628722180149,"t":"you a few things about our journey.","h":0.01435716132533571,"c":1},{"h":0.011778563015312105,"w":0.67078191121419273,"c":1,"t":"Our boats aren't huge as you can see. We already have three staff members on board and","x":0.10288064922829468,"y":0.53621908107436744},{"w":0.67087320963541675,"h":0.014146599247261915,"c":1,"x":0.10284066621169377,"y":0.54983054588735247,"t":"on top of that, we can transport a further fifteen people - that's you - around the coastline."},{"w":0.65226338704427089,"x":0.10288065204589258,"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1,"t":"But please note if there are more than nine people on either side of the boat, we'll move","y":0.56537102457625288},{"x":0.1028806655667851,"w":0.50823043823242187,"t":"some of you over, otherwise all eighteen of us will end up in the sea!","y":0.57979976456976168,"h":0.011778563015312216,"c":1},{"t":"We've recently upgraded all our boats. They used to be jet black, but our new ones now have","y":0.60174418594020818,"w":0.68930043538411456,"c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.10288064639810585},{"t":"these comfortable dark red seats and a light-green exterior in order to stand out from others","x":0.10082305143519031,"w":0.68106994628906248,"y":0.61482558127501175,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1},{"t":"and help promote our company. This gives our boats a rather unique appearance, don't you","h":0.011778563015312216,"c":1,"y":0.63074204925906763,"w":0.67695475260416671,"x":0.10288064828470188},{"h":0.014606511775399844,"c":1,"x":0.100025324729308,"t":"think?","y":0.64349280865628666,"w":0.049091488520304372},{"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"We offer you a free lunchbox during the trip and we have three types. Lunchbox 1 contains","x":0.1028806492173347,"w":0.67078191121419262,"c":1,"y":0.66569767429880333},{"w":0.66460906982421875,"x":0.10288065025495484,"y":0.6802120141570952,"c":1,"t":"ham and tomato sandwiches. Lunchbox 2 contains a cheddar cheese roll and Lunchbox 3","h":0.011778563015312105},{"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1,"t":"is salad-based and also contains eggs and tuna. All three lunchboxes also have a packet of","x":0.1008230515636373,"y":0.69464075358912569,"w":0.68106994628906259},{"t":"crisps and chocolate bar inside. Please let staff know which lunchbox you prefer.","w":0.59670781453450517,"y":0.70930232547479666,"c":1,"x":0.10288066052961028,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"y":0.73110465105644695,"t":"I'm sure I don't have to ask you not to throw anything into the sea. We don't have any bins to","x":0.10288065550140639,"w":0.68518519083658858,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"put litter in, but Jess, myself or Ray, our other guide, will collect it from you after lunch and put","x":0.10288067089581791,"y":0.74558303884134058,"h":0.011778563015312105,"w":0.69547322591145833},{"c":1,"x":0.10288065723120046,"t":"it all in a large plastic sack.","y":0.76017441849403899,"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.20164609273274739},{"y":0.56540697660093409,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"x":0.81687242814852068,"t":"Q11","w":0.032921810150146502},{"y":0.61482558123691577,"w":0.037037035624186032,"c":1,"x":0.81687242858708387,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Q12"},{"w":0.037037035624186032,"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.81687242858708387,"c":1,"y":0.68023255799870552,"t":"Q13"},{"y":0.74563953474502886,"c":1,"t":"Q14","w":0.037037035624186143,"h":0.011627907185728703,"x":0.81687242859313569},{"y":0.80087209290368333,"t":"The engine on the boat makes quite a lot of noise so before we head off, let me tell you a few","x":0.10288064639973517,"w":0.68930043538411456,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"t":"things about what you're going to see.","y":0.81684334492402288,"w":0.28395062764485679,"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1,"x":0.10288065313336839},{"x":0.8580246914705375,"w":0.024691357612609877,"c":1,"t":"97","h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.86773255796252025},{"t":"IELTSXpress.com","w":0.30612678527832038,"y":0.95314993796778535,"h":0.03375352650564889,"c":1,"x":0.66991655033568553}],"h":3395}